{
  "release": "0.28.0",
  "from": "0.27.0",
  "about": "Every class 0.28.0 renames, old name to the class or classes that give the same look. Replace a whole class token, never a prefix: btn-go becomes two classes, and renaming it to btn--go alone turns a filled button into a soft one. The old names are gone; nothing aliases them.",
